      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Upload IMAGE 1. Add IMAGE 2, 3, etc. only as needed. Leave unused slots at None; every slot is ALREADY WIRED. Fill left to right, then second row.\n2. Type what you want. Auto chooses edit, new scene, recreation or description. Use the task dropdown to force a mode. Role hints are optional.\n3. Queue once. The vision model examines the pictures, builds a visual brief, writes the prompt and unloads. No diffusion model, VAE or sampler runs.\n4. Copy final prompt or Download prompt .txt on the writer node. Save .txt also writes output/prompt_studio/. Only prompt text is exported.\nEDIT/NEW SCENE: attach the same images in the SAME order wherever you paste the prompt. RECREATE: text-only prompt, no reference required.\nChanging the seed forces a fresh variation. Exact recreation/likeness is not guaranteed by text. Requires the Prompt Studio code update and your installed Ollama vision model."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "Note",
      "title": "EXAMPLES - use the same workflow",
      "pos": [
