      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 10,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "DOG SWAP: Image 1 = original scene with dog A; image 2 = dog B face; image 3 = dog B body. Request: Replace the dog in image 1 with the dog from images 2 and 3.\nRECREATE: Load one photo. Request: Write a text-to-image prompt to recreate this photograph as closely as possible.\nDESCRIBE: Load one or more pictures. Select Describe the image(s). Request: Describe what is actually visible, including the pose, framing and light.\nOTHER TASKS: Combine people, transfer clothing, place a product in a scene, change an object, invent a new setting, or describe a design.\nThis workflow has its own visual-planning instructions. It does NOT call the old automatic edit-rewrite routine. Writing guidance on the node is editable."
      ]
    }
